title: The Trade Unions
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and unions_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.unions_timer = 3;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.c_union_expelled = 0;
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: movement

= The Trade Unions

[? if year <= 1920 : Millions of workers have poured into the Free Trade Unions since the war, and their leaders back Ebert. ?][? if year >= 1921 : The ADGB has eight million members, and its leaders expel communists who organise against them. ?] [? if ultraleft_gone = 0 : The Left Radicals say the old unions are dead and must be replaced. ?][? if ultraleft_gone = 1 : The KAPD and its General Workers' Union say the old unions must be smashed. Some of our own members agree. ?]

- @inside: Work inside the existing unions.
- @fractions: Organise disciplined communist fractions in every branch.
- @outside: Build revolutionary unions outside them.
- @easy_discard

@inside
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Slow, unglamorous work. Worker support grows steadily.
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the old unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 6;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

Communists stand in union elections and speak at every branch meeting.

@fractions
subtitle: [? if lock_union_work = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Some branches fall to us. The party's union department expects expulsions in return.
view-if: year >= 1921
choose-if: lock_union_work < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids work inside the old unions.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_union_work == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 4;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 4);
if (Math.random() < 0.5) {
    Q.c_union_expelled = 1;
    Q.spd_relation -= 6;
    for (var d of Q.districts) {
        Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.97;
    }
}
!}

Every communist in a union belongs to a fraction that meets before the branch meeting and votes as one. [? if c_union_expelled = 1 : The metalworkers' executive expels two hundred of our people in a single week, and some of them leave the party too. ?]

@outside
subtitle: Small, militant unions, and a split workforce.
on-arrival: {!
Q.militancy += 4;
Q.worker_support -= 2;
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone) {
    Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 10;
    Q.lean_ultraleft += 2;
} else {
    Q.kapd_relation += 6;
    Q.lean_offensive += 1;
}
!}

The comrades tear up their union books in the canteen and found a works union of their own, with a red card and no officials.
